            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Description",
            "content": "<p>AutoLinkr Tablet™ is the portable wireless CarPlay and Android Auto screen that works in any car — no factory CarPlay required. Just mount it on your dashboard or windshield, connect your phone, and you're streaming and navigating in under 60 seconds.<\/p><p>The 7\" HD touchscreen supports Netflix, YouTube, Hulu, Disney+, Google Maps, Waze, Spotify, and the full Google Play Store. It works with both iPhone and Android out of the box.<\/p><p>Unlike other CarPlay adapters that require your car to already have CarPlay built in, AutoLinkr Tablet™ brings the full connected experience to any vehicle — from a 2005 Toyota to a 2024 pickup truck.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-compatibility": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Compatibility",
            "content": "<p><strong>Works in any car<\/strong> — no factory CarPlay required.<\/p><ul><li>iPhone 7+ (iOS 10 or later) for Apple CarPlay<\/li><li>Android 11+ for Android Auto<\/li><li>Connects via Bluetooth + USB-C or USB-A<\/li><li>Universal air vent or dashboard mount included<\/li><\/ul><p>Unlike standard CarPlay adapters, AutoLinkr Tablet™ is a standalone device — it doesn't need to plug into your car's infotainment system.<\/p>",
            "page": "",
            "liquid": "",
            "text_size": "text-sm"
          }
        },
        "tab-specs": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "opened": false,
            "style": "with-border",
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Tech Specs",
            "content": "<ul><li>Screen: 7\" IPS HD touchscreen (1024×600)<\/li><li>Wireless: Bluetooth 5.0, WiFi 2.4GHz\/5GHz dual-band<\/li><li>OS: Android-based<\/li><li>Connections: USB-C power, FM transmitter, Bluetooth audio<\/li><li>Compatible: Apple CarPlay (wireless), Android Auto (wireless)<\/li><li>Mount: Universal air vent mount included<\/li><li>Power: Powered via car USB port or included adapter<\/li><\/ul>",
